  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Aston University's new London campus builds on the institution's proud legacy, providing you with a modern environment for learning. With this new campus, you'll have access to the many academic and professional opportunities that London offers.</p><p>What’s more is that Aston University is internationally recognised for its excellence in Business and Social Sciences. You can also study at Aston Business School, which is among the top 1% of business schools worldwide to hold triple accreditation (AACSB, EQUIS, AMBA).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Aston University's London campus boasts a high student satisfaction rate, so you can be assured of an enriching student experience. You'll find a welcoming community of students from all over the world. Plus, with regular networking events and industry meetups, you'll have plenty of opportunities to build valuable connections for your future career. Plus, you get comprehensive student support, counselling, and mental wellbeing services too.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>When you have an unconditional offer to study full-time at the university, you can book accommodations through the university.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
